## YappieYappie

This is a project for creating a space for myself and my people where we can chat and .

The final structure would be something similar to the below one:

        Yappie_F/

├── lib/
│ ├── core/ # constants, theme, extensions, utils
│ ├── features/
│ │ ├── auth/ # login, signup, guest
│ │ ├── chat/ # private chat screen + services
│ │ ├── chat_list/ # recent chats list
│ │ ├── search/ # Instagram-style search
│ │ ├── profile/ # profile + logout
│ │ └── home/ # bottom navigation shell
│ ├── models/ # UserModel, MessageModel, ChatModel
│ ├── services/ # AuthService, FirestoreService, ChatService
│ ├── providers/ # Riverpod providers (modern & production-ready)
│ ├── firebase_options.dart
│ └── main.dart
├── assets/
├── android/ & ios/
└── pubspec.yaml
